OL,3,CTributes to 'beloved' nan who died
OL,4,Cafter being hit by car
OL,6,FThe "heartbroken" family of a "beloved
OL,7,Fnan" who was struck by a car and
OL,8,Fkilled say their lives "will never be
OL,9,Fthe same".
OL,11,FAnn Johnson died after she was hit by
OL,12,Fa car on Black Lane, Macclesfield, on
OL,13,FThursday, 2 July. After suffering
OL,14,Fserious injuries, she died five days
OL,15,Flater on Tuesday, 7 July.
OL,17,FIn a statement, Ann's family paid
OL,18,Ftribute to their "beloved nan." They
OL,19,Fsaid: "Our family have been left
OL,20,Fdevastated and heartbroken by the
OL,21,Ftragic events of the 2 July.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
