OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785154708
OL,3,CTributes to 'beloved' nan who died
OL,4,Cafter being hit by car
OL,6,F"Ann was a beloved mother and mother-
OL,7,Fin-law, sister, aunt, grandmother and
OL,8,Fgreat grandmother, and a friend to
OL,9,Fmany whose lives she touched.
OL,11,F"Twice widowed, she was at her
OL,12,Fhappiest helping others and her love
OL,13,Fand support will be sorely missed.
OL,14,FLife will never be the same, however
OL,15,Fthe many messages we have received are
OL,16,Fa great source of comfort and solace."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
